{"synopsis":"RyuYeon kehilangan ayahnya karena penyakit ketika dia baru berusia 10 tahun Dengan keterampilan yang ia pelajari dari ayahnya ia dapat mengukir kayu menjadi patung yang sangat rumit Suatu hari setelah menyelesaikan pahatan orang tuanya RyuYeon disambut oleh seorang lelaki tua yang terkesan dengan pahatannya Pria tua itu melihat potensi pada RyuYeon dan bertanya apakah dia ingin menjadi muridnya Karena RyuYeon tidak punya tempat untuk pergi dan ingin melakukan yang terbaik dalam hidupnya ia menerima tawaran lelaki tua itu","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Awin, Galanthorn","artist":"Awin; Wuzhou","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"9b2478b4-c466-429a-a8bf-f8284f625114","number":"220","chapter":"220","title":"","date":"2025-12-26","released":"2025-12-26"},{"chapter_id":"69050209-ce6e-42fe-ac2d-d9c15cd2216a","number":"219","chapter":"219","title":"","date":"2025-12-24","released":"2025-12-24"},{"chapter_id":"3256799d-0d20-4481-902e-a8a066a6c708","number":"218","chapter":"218","title":"","date":"2025-12-22","released":"2025-12-22"},{"chapter_id":"53a8b441-6bd3-41f0-ae1f-c98568c611a4","number":"217","chapter":"217","title":"","date":"2025-12-14","released":"2025-12-14"},{"chapter_id":"aed17c4c-6bae-4bbb-9787-7f956618548f","number":"216","chapter":"216","title":"","date":"2025-11-23","released":"2025-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"7d4de3bd-e038-4b7a-80c2-9fa9e3183bc0","number":"215","chapter":"215","title":"","date":"2025-11-12","released":"2025-11-12"},{"chapter_id":"4610aaaf-d4b6-4683-ba5c-2c7bafec7a0c","number":"214","chapter":"214","title":"","date":"2025-11-01","released":"2025-11-01"},{"chapter_id":"8fcc8294-d89b-4670-a0d6-956e3b203fea","number":"213","chapter":"213","title":"","date":"2025-09-23","released":"2025-09-23"},{"chapter_id":"58fdc70d-f727-44e7-8e9b-a600646641e5","number":"212","chapter":"212","title":"","date":"2025-09-05","released":"2025-09-05"},{"chapter_id":"2a4c207e-ccf6-4998-a134-9d3ad141bf32","number":"211","chapter":"211","title":"","date":"2